<title>INDIA: India M&amp;M 1996/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>India M&amp;M 1996/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		    (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>		Net profit	  2,093.3    vs   1,680.8</p>
<p>		Income	     36,075.7    vs  28,995.6</p>
<p>		Dividend (rupees)     5.0    vs	 4.5</p>
<p>		Depreciation	  629.6    vs     423.3</p>
<p>		Interest		805.1    vs     481.5</p>
<p>		Tax		   1,190.0    vs   1,165.0</p>
<p>		Balance of profit 1,006.5    vs     599.6</p>
<p>		for earlier yrs</p>
<p>		Profit available  3,130.5    vs  2,273.0</p>
<p>		for appropriation</p>
<p>Note: Tractor and utility vehicle maker Mahindra &amp; Mahindra Ltd said tractor output during the year was 58,028 units againt 49,651 units a year ago. Tractor sales amounted to 57,379 units against 50,005 units a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
